      <h2 class="tt-sec-heading">About me and the interpretations</h2>
      <p class="tt-about-body">
        My name is Mark Irwin. I am 47, originally from Cork in Ireland, and I
        have lived in Kempen since 2015. My work with dreams began in 2011: I
        came across the Aisling Method and started following my own dreams
        systematically. Night after night, over years. What began as personal
        curiosity became a daily practice. In 2023 I began learning the Aisling
        Method and how to channel formally from Michael Sheridan himself; the
        certifications followed in 2024 and 2026.
      </p>
      <p class="tt-about-body">
        <strong class="tt-about-lead">A method, not mysticism.</strong>
        I work with the Aisling Method, one of the few dream interpretation
        frameworks that has been applied and refined in practised use over
        decades. No generic symbol lists. No spiritual projections. A method
        that takes seriously what your soul is saying.
      </p>
      <p class="tt-about-body">
